1. Pehle dependency vulnerabilities check karo
pip install pip-audit
pip-audit

Ye installed Python packages me known vulnerabilities check karega.

2. API endpoints identify karo
FastAPI me normally:

http://localhost:8000/docs
http://localhost:8000/redoc

Open karo. /docs se tumhe endpoints aur request parameters clearly mil jayenge.

3. Har endpoint ko test karo
For example:

curl -i http://localhost:8000/users/123

Test these cases:

Authentication ke bina request

Invalid/expired token

Missing parameters

Wrong data types

Bahut large input

Unauthorized user ka resource ID

Unexpected HTTP methods

4. Authorization bug specifically check karo
Maan lo:

GET /users/10/profile

User 10 ka profile sirf user 10 ko milna chahiye. Login user 20 se request karke dekho ki user 10 ka data accidentally accessible to nahi.

Ye IDOR/BOLA type vulnerability ho sakti hai.

5. Automated scanner
Apni local/staging API par OWASP ZAP use karke automated security testing kar sakte ho. Production/third-party APIs ko scan karne se pehle authorization zaroor hona chahiye.

Agar tum chaho, apni FastAPI ka code yahan paste karo. Main line-by-line security audit karke bata sakta hoon ki kaha bug ho sakta hai aur uska secure fix kya hoga.